From a85525d98effb1fc75314f0541e30998780511a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 19:36:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf: SIMD reed modes and zip the voice mix bus

Keep the 7-mode oscillator at f64. Load modes 0-5 as f64x2 pairs and
leave mode 6 scalar so the jitter LCG order stays the same. A C4
checksum locks the path to the previous scalar bits.

Replace the remaining index mix loops with zip iterators.
